{"4832350":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"You Must Die","steam_appid":4832350,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU MUST DIE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice. Choose your path. Hunt dangerous enemies. Survive the next bounty.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Must Die<\/i> is a dice-building roguelike where every face matters. Customize your dice, discover powerful abilities, collect game-changing relics, and fight your way through increasingly dangerous bounties in turn-based combat where every roll can change the fight.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN DICE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for the dice you're given?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace individual faces, combine them into stronger abilities, and transform ordinary dice into powerful weapons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around devastating critical hits, impenetrable defenses, magical attacks, debilitating status effects, or unusual combinations of abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every face you collect opens up new possibilities.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL THE DICE. FACE THE CONSEQUENCES.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your customized dice into turn-based battles against groups of enemies, each with their own abilities, traits, and combat strategies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance offense and defense, assign your attacks to different targets, and reserve dice for future turns when the odds aren't in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze enemy dice, inflict bleeding, unleash magical attacks, and combine abilities to overcome increasingly dangerous encounters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful build can turn the odds in your favor, but even the strongest dice won't guarantee victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHARACTER. FORGE YOUR STRATEGY.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different adventurers bring different strengths to the battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock playable characters with their own starting dice, unique relics, and combat styles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer a defensive approach or an aggressive strategy, your character is only the beginning. The dice you collect and the choices you make will determine how your build develops.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT DANGEROUS BOUNTIES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on expeditions filled with enemies, rewards, unpredictable events, and challenging bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate branching bounty maps and choose your route through combat encounters, mysterious shrines, merchants, and opportunities to recover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to claim new die faces, equipment, food, and relics that can reshape your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete bounties to unlock new rewards, expand your options, and prepare for even greater challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every expedition is another chance to strengthen your arsenal—or lose everything.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE FOR THE NEXT EXPEDITION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between bounties, return to town to improve your chances of survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit merchants, customize your dice, cook meals, discover new recipes, and prepare your next build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent unlocks through your victories, giving you more options for future adventures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dice are only as good as the decisions behind them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your dice. Your build. Your fate.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU MUST DIE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice. Choose your path. Hunt dangerous enemies. Survive the next bounty.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Must Die<\/i> is a dice-building roguelike where every face matters. Customize your dice, discover powerful abilities, collect game-changing relics, and fight your way through increasingly dangerous bounties in turn-based combat where every roll can change the fight.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN DICE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for the dice you're given?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace individual faces, combine them into stronger abilities, and transform ordinary dice into powerful weapons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around devastating critical hits, impenetrable defenses, magical attacks, debilitating status effects, or unusual combinations of abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every face you collect opens up new possibilities.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/1f30f77ae05a2301375aea8539f38b85.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL THE DICE. FACE THE CONSEQUENCES.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your customized dice into turn-based battles against groups of enemies, each with their own abilities, traits, and combat strategies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance offense and defense, assign your attacks to different targets, and reserve dice for future turns when the odds aren't in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze enemy dice, inflict bleeding, unleash magical attacks, and combine abilities to overcome increasingly dangerous encounters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful build can turn the odds in your favor, but even the strongest dice won't guarantee victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/806e393e6682a302fb061e94a0817132.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHARACTER. FORGE YOUR STRATEGY.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different adventurers bring different strengths to the battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock playable characters with their own starting dice, unique relics, and combat styles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer a defensive approach or an aggressive strategy, your character is only the beginning. The dice you collect and the choices you make will determine how your build develops.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT DANGEROUS BOUNTIES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on expeditions filled with enemies, rewards, unpredictable events, and challenging bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate branching bounty maps and choose your route through combat encounters, mysterious shrines, merchants, and opportunities to recover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to claim new die faces, equipment, food, and relics that can reshape your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete bounties to unlock new rewards, expand your options, and prepare for even greater challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every expedition is another chance to strengthen your arsenal—or lose everything.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/abbe32d16b905868e7af12a806ab75f3.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.poster.avif?t=1793646711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.webm?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/extras\/ac2b4b4fa5a74dff4c03cf736a300395.mp4?t=1793646711\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE FOR THE NEXT EXPEDITION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between bounties, return to town to improve your chances of survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit merchants, customize your dice, cook meals, discover new recipes, and prepare your next build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent unlocks through your victories, giving you more options for future adventures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dice are only as good as the decisions behind them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your dice. Your build. Your fate.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Build your own dice in this turn-based roguelike! Customize individual faces, combine powerful abilities, hunt dangerous bounties, and collect new dice and relics to create devastating builds. Every face matters. Every roll counts.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/80ad25f60b6ba3ac9c0bafec6e005a6678d38331\/header.jpg?t=1793646711","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/b264ba4d7f68e55a2d58426add5c208a122fc438\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793646711","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832350\/b264ba4d7f68e55a2d58426add5c208a122fc438\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793646711","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 98 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 100 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":